      "parameters": {
        "content": "## G2-1 \u2014 Slack alert when a target posts a sales/RevOps role\n\n**Who:** recruiters / founders watching Ashby boards.\n\n**Flow:** Schedule \u2192 Buyer inputs \u2192 Apify `publicrecords/ashby-jobs-scraper` (run-sync-get-dataset-items) \u2192 Code filter (sales/RevOps titles) \u2192 Slack.\n\n**Setup:** 1) Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <APIFY_TOKEN>` (publisher). 2) Slack bot token credential. 3) Edit companies / since / maxResults. 4) Full ~200 slug list: `ashby-board-slugs.json` (import path `examples/g2-1-slack-hiring-alert/`).\n\n**Cost:** actor-start $0.005 + $0.0009/job; keep maxResults\u226420 and maxTotalChargeUsd\u22640.5 for demos.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
